body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1354\n\nHistorical intake (2026-09-30): the reporter verified direct Node test success and linked snapshot failure (ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND), with a root-dependency positive control, on published 2026.9.29. Source investigation was pending at intake; this work was excluded from PR #1353.\n\nContract: snapshot execution retains distinct root and nested package dependency resolution while isolating both tracker roots. Copied source and included source aliases stay disposable. Installed dependency directories are deliberately shared by convention, so dependency writes require an independent install.\n\nDelivery: PR #1375 implements and verifies the current contract. Comments, linked tests, run receipts, resolution and immutable close evidence record the actual current result; the historical reporter version alone does not establish current behavior."
